# PLAN-926 a2c-hir collections suite - the C collections channel's first
# evidence set (ac-a2c/hir-collections-emit-v1, HIR to C11 with the nominal
# type table + collections runtime): the TWENTY frozen 904 originals
# (byte-exact L01..L07 / V01..V07 / LSTR864 / FIN864A/B / N889 x3) through
# the real A2X C chain. The DAILY check is the emit-only golden compare
# (spawn-zero); the certification leg (real cl compile+run of the actual
# set AND the independent hand-written reference-<case>.c against the
# frozen oracle, strict ace.a2c-hir.collections.cert/1 carrying the
# execution-config identity) is the explicit certify axis owned by the
# worker conformance tests. Every included case is green by real emission
# on the current tree; the a2r 904 suite and the C scalar/record-text 921/
# 925 suites are untouched (parallel channels, mutually untrusted).

